# capture.py regenerates everything below from its own deterministic ramps and
# the vips binary, so only capture.py, commands.sh, oracle.json and the .avif
# files a port would embed verbatim are pinned.
#
# outputs/ holds the intermediate .v files and the probe images for records
# that need no fixture: the bitdepth argument domain, the ftyp brand sweep,
# the encoder sweep, the metadata that `--keep all` synthesises.
fixtures/*.raw
outputs/
